# Atomicity Guarantees in Java

[![Mostafa Elganainy](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:64:64/1*3IPatvrRJkz3o98oXaJllA.png)](https://medium.com/@melganainy?source=post_page---byline--ef313b2de38-----------------------------------------)

